{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 57,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 551.784,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that I received an epistle from Ammoron, the king,",
      "verse": "57:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.499,
      "end": 9.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "stating that if I would deliver up those prisoners of war whom we had taken",
      "verse": "57:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.834,
      "end": 13.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would deliver up the city of Antiparah unto us.",
      "verse": "57:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 13.765,
      "end": 16.876,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I sent an epistle unto the king, that we were sure",
      "verse": "57:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 17.056,
      "end": 21.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "our forces were sufficient to take the city of Antiparah by our force;",
      "verse": "57:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 21.973,
      "end": 25.317,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by delivering up the prisoners for that city",
      "verse": "57:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 25.497,
      "end": 28.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we should suppose ourselves unwise,",
      "verse": "57:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 28.185,
      "end": 32.086,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that we would only deliver up our prisoners on exchange.",
      "verse": "57:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 32.766,
      "end": 34.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammoron refused mine epistle,",
      "verse": "57:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 35.175,
      "end": 37.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he would not exchange prisoners;",
      "verse": "57:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 37.77,
      "end": 42.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore we began to make preparations to go against the city of Antiparah.",
      "verse": "57:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 42.722,
      "end": 45.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the people of Antiparah did leave the city,",
      "verse": "57:4",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 45.874,
      "end": 50.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and fled to their other cities, which they had possession of, to fortify them;",
      "verse": "57:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 50.791,
      "end": 54.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus the city of Antiparah fell into our hands.",
      "verse": "57:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 54.722,
      "end": 58.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus ended the twenty and eighth year of the reign of the judges.",
      "verse": "57:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 59.674,
      "end": 67.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that in the commencement of the twenty and ninth year, we received a supply of provisions,",
      "verse": "57:6",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 67.331,
      "end": 71.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also an addition to our army, from the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "57:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 71.598,
      "end": 73.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and from the land round about,",
      "verse": "57:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 73.775,
      "end": 76.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the number of six thousand men,",
      "verse": "57:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 76.323,
      "end": 79.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "besides sixty of the sons of the Ammonites",
      "verse": "57:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 79.289,
      "end": 84.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had come to join their brethren, my little band of two thousand.",
      "verse": "57:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 84.856,
      "end": 86.992,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, we were strong,",
      "verse": "57:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 87.172,
      "end": 90.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and we had also plenty of provisions brought unto us.",
      "verse": "57:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 91.196,
      "end": 94.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that it was our desire to wage a battle",
      "verse": "57:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 94.859,
      "end": 98.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "with the army which was placed to protect the city Cumeni.",
      "verse": "57:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 98.883,
      "end": 101.437,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, I will show unto you",
      "verse": "57:8",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 101.617,
      "end": 104.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we soon accomplished our desire;",
      "verse": "57:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 104.305,
      "end": 107.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, with our strong force, or with a part of our strong force,",
      "verse": "57:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 107.968,
      "end": 110.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we did surround, by night, the city Cumeni,",
      "verse": "57:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 111.027,
      "end": 114.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a little before they were to receive a supply of provisions.",
      "verse": "57:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 115.515,
      "end": 120.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we did camp round about the city for many nights;",
      "verse": "57:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 120.2,
      "end": 123.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but we did sleep upon our swords, and keep guards,",
      "verse": "57:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 123.863,
      "end": 127.903,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lamanites could not come upon us by night and slay us,",
      "verse": "57:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 128.083,
      "end": 130.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which they attempted many times;",
      "verse": "57:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 130.585,
      "end": 134.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but as many times as they attempted this their blood was spilt.",
      "verse": "57:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 135.352,
      "end": 137.767,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "At length their provisions did arrive,",
      "verse": "57:10",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 137.947,
      "end": 140.733,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were about to enter the city by night.",
      "verse": "57:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 140.913,
      "end": 144.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we, instead of being Lamanites, were Nephites;",
      "verse": "57:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 144.948,
      "end": 148.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, we did take them and their provisions.",
      "verse": "57:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 148.693,
      "end": 153.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And notwithstanding the Lamanites being cut off from their support after this manner,",
      "verse": "57:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 154.167,
      "end": 156.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they were still determined to maintain the city;",
      "verse": "57:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 157.133,
      "end": 163.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore it became expedient that we should take those provisions and send them to Judea,",
      "verse": "57:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 163.629,
      "end": 166.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our prisoners to the land of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "57:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 166.817,
      "end": 173.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that not many days had passed away before the Lamanites began to lose all hopes of succor;",
      "verse": "57:12",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 174.102,
      "end": 177.26,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they yielded up the city unto our hands;",
      "verse": "57:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 177.44,
      "end": 181.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus we had accomplished our designs in obtaining the city Cumeni.",
      "verse": "57:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 182.3,
      "end": 185.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But it came to pass that our prisoners were so numerous",
      "verse": "57:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 185.917,
      "end": 189.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that, notwithstanding the enormity of our numbers,",
      "verse": "57:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 189.301,
      "end": 192.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we were obliged to employ all our force to keep them,",
      "verse": "57:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 192.639,
      "end": 194.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or to put them to death.",
      "verse": "57:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 194.805,
      "end": 198.009,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, they would break out in great numbers,",
      "verse": "57:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 198.189,
      "end": 201.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and would fight with stones, and with clubs,",
      "verse": "57:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 201.295,
      "end": 204.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or whatsoever thing they could get into their hands,",
      "verse": "57:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 204.354,
      "end": 207.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that we did slay upwards of two thousand of them",
      "verse": "57:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 208.063,
      "end": 211.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after they had surrendered themselves prisoners of war.",
      "verse": "57:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 211.901,
      "end": 214.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore it became expedient for us,",
      "verse": "57:15",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 214.682,
      "end": 217.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we should put an end to their lives,",
      "verse": "57:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 217.788,
      "end": 221.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or guard them, sword in hand, down to the land of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "57:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 221.73,
      "end": 226.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also our provisions were not any more than sufficient for our own people,",
      "verse": "57:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 226.786,
      "end": 230.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "notwithstanding that which we had taken from the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "57:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 231.553,
      "end": 233.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, in those critical circumstances,",
      "verse": "57:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 234.055,
      "end": 238.931,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it became a very serious matter to determine concerning these prisoners of war;",
      "verse": "57:16",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 239.111,
      "end": 243.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, we did resolve to send them down to the land of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "57:16",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 243.703,
      "end": 246.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore we selected a part of our men,",
      "verse": "57:16",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 246.716,
      "end": 251.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and gave them charge over our prisoners to go down to the land of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "57:16",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 251.808,
      "end": 254.827,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But it came to pass that on the morrow they did return.",
      "verse": "57:17",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 255.007,
      "end": 258.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, we did not inquire of them concerning the prisoners;",
      "verse": "57:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 258.856,
      "end": 261.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, the Lamanites were upon us,",
      "verse": "57:17",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 261.822,
      "end": 266.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they returned in season to save us from falling into their hands.",
      "verse": "57:17",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 266.46,
      "end": 274.494,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, Ammoron had sent to their support a new supply of provisions and also a numerous army of men.",
      "verse": "57:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 275.174,
      "end": 279.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that those men whom we sent with the prisoners",
      "verse": "57:18",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 279.487,
      "end": 284.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did arrive in season to check them, as they were about to overpower us.",
      "verse": "57:18",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 285.368,
      "end": 290.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, my little band of two thousand and sixty fought most desperately;",
      "verse": "57:19",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 290.564,
      "end": 293.211,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they were firm before the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "57:19",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 293.391,
      "end": 297.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did administer death unto all those who opposed them.",
      "verse": "57:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 297.833,
      "end": 302.245,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as the remainder of our army were about to give way before the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "57:20",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 302.425,
      "end": 306.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, those two thousand and sixty were firm and undaunted.",
      "verse": "57:20",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 307.285,
      "end": 312.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and they did obey and observe to perform every word of command with exactness;",
      "verse": "57:21",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 312.573,
      "end": 316.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and even according to their faith it was done unto them;",
      "verse": "57:21",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 316.282,
      "end": 321.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I did remember the words which they said unto me that their mothers had taught them.",
      "verse": "57:21",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 322.488,
      "end": 324.903,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, it was these my sons,",
      "verse": "57:22",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 325.083,
      "end": 328.752,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those men who had been selected to convey the prisoners,",
      "verse": "57:22",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 328.932,
      "end": 331.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to whom we owe this great victory;",
      "verse": "57:22",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 331.62,
      "end": 334.453,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it was they who did beat the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "57:22",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 334.633,
      "end": 337.698,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they were driven back to the city of Manti.",
      "verse": "57:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 338.378,
      "end": 340.654,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we retained our city Cumeni,",
      "verse": "57:23",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 340.834,
      "end": 343.202,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were not all destroyed by the sword;",
      "verse": "57:23",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 343.382,
      "end": 345.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, we had suffered great loss.",
      "verse": "57:23",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 346.523,
      "end": 353.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after the Lamanites had fled, I immediately gave orders that my men who had been wounded",
      "verse": "57:24",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 353.437,
      "end": 355.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should be taken from among the dead,",
      "verse": "57:24",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 355.985,
      "end": 358.771,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and caused that their wounds should be dressed.",
      "verse": "57:24",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 359.451,
      "end": 364.42,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there were two hundred, out of my two thousand and sixty,",
      "verse": "57:25",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 364.6,
      "end": 367.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had fainted because of the loss of blood;",
      "verse": "57:25",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 367.566,
      "end": 370.306,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, according to the goodness of God,",
      "verse": "57:25",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 370.486,
      "end": 374.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to our great astonishment, and also the joy of our whole army,",
      "verse": "57:25",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 375.124,
      "end": 378.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there was not one soul of them who did perish;",
      "verse": "57:25",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 378.23,
      "end": 382.828,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and neither was there one soul among them who had not received many wounds.",
      "verse": "57:25",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 383.508,
      "end": 386.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, their preservation was astonishing to our whole army,",
      "verse": "57:26",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 386.985,
      "end": 389.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, that they should be spared",
      "verse": "57:26",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 389.301,
      "end": 392.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while there was a thousand of our brethren who were slain.",
      "verse": "57:26",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 392.825,
      "end": 398.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we do justly ascribe it to the miraculous power of God, because of their exceeding faith in that",
      "verse": "57:26",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 398.903,
      "end": 403.872,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which they had been taught to believe\u2014 that there was a just God,",
      "verse": "57:26",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 404.052,
      "end": 409.021,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whosoever did not doubt, that they should be preserved by his marvelous power.",
      "verse": "57:26",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 409.701,
      "end": 413.23,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was the faith of these of whom I have spoken;",
      "verse": "57:27",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 413.41,
      "end": 416.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they are young, and their minds are firm,",
      "verse": "57:27",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 416.237,
      "end": 419.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they do put their trust in God continually.",
      "verse": "57:27",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 419.889,
      "end": 424.394,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that after we had thus taken care of our wounded men,",
      "verse": "57:28",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 424.574,
      "end": 430.518,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had buried our dead and also the dead of the Lamanites, who were many,",
      "verse": "57:28",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 430.698,
      "end": 434.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, we did inquire of Gid concerning the prisoners",
      "verse": "57:28",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 434.315,
      "end": 438.541,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom they had started to go down to the land of Zarahemla with.",
      "verse": "57:28",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 439.221,
      "end": 441.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Gid was the chief captain over the band",
      "verse": "57:29",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 442.048,
      "end": 445.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who was appointed to guard them down to the land.",
      "verse": "57:29",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 445.979,
      "end": 449.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, these are the words which Gid said unto me:",
      "verse": "57:30",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 449.967,
      "end": 454.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, we did start to go down to the land of Zarahemla with our prisoners.",
      "verse": "57:30",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 455.07,
      "end": 459.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we did meet the spies of our armies,",
      "verse": "57:30",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 459.244,
      "end": 462.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had been sent out to watch the camp of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "57:30",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 463.314,
      "end": 465.172,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they cried unto us, saying\u2014",
      "verse": "57:31",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 465.352,
      "end": 470.414,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, the armies of the Lamanites are marching towards the city of Cumeni;",
      "verse": "57:31",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 470.594,
      "end": 472.87,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, they will fall upon them,",
      "verse": "57:31",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 473.05,
      "end": 475.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and will destroy our people.",
      "verse": "57:31",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 476.145,
      "end": 480.046,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that our prisoners did hear their cries,",
      "verse": "57:32",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 480.226,
      "end": 482.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which caused them to take courage;",
      "verse": "57:32",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 482.728,
      "end": 485.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did rise up in rebellion against us.",
      "verse": "57:32",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 486.055,
      "end": 488.656,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass because of their rebellion",
      "verse": "57:33",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 488.836,
      "end": 492.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we did cause that our swords should come upon them.",
      "verse": "57:33",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 492.638,
      "end": 496.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did in a body run upon our swords,",
      "verse": "57:33",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 497.09,
      "end": 500.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which, the greater number of them were slain;",
      "verse": "57:33",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 500.335,
      "end": 503.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the remainder of them broke through and fled from us.",
      "verse": "57:33",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 504.544,
      "end": 508.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, when they had fled and we could not overtake them,",
      "verse": "57:34",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 508.857,
      "end": 512.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we took our march with speed towards the city Cumeni;",
      "verse": "57:34",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 512.381,
      "end": 514.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, we did arrive in time",
      "verse": "57:34",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 514.883,
      "end": 518.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we might assist our brethren in preserving the city.",
      "verse": "57:34",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 519.232,
      "end": 523.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, we are again delivered out of the hands of our enemies.",
      "verse": "57:35",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 523.359,
      "end": 525.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And blessed is the name of our God;",
      "verse": "57:35",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 525.629,
      "end": 528.601,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, it is he that has delivered us;",
      "verse": "57:35",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 528.781,
      "end": 531.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, that has done this great thing for us.",
      "verse": "57:35",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 531.922,
      "end": 537.866,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that when I, Helaman, had heard these words of Gid,",
      "verse": "57:36",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 538.046,
      "end": 541.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I was filled with exceeding joy because of the goodness of God",
      "verse": "57:36",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 541.709,
      "end": 544.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in preserving us, that we might not all perish;",
      "verse": "57:36",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 545.0,
      "end": 548.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I trust that the souls of them who have been slain",
      "verse": "57:36",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 548.756,
      "end": 551.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have entered into the rest of their God.",
      "verse": "57:36",
      "lineIndex": 143
    }
  ]
}